#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_images.rst:-1
msgid "Kdenlive Documentation - Title Images"
msgstr "Dokumentácia Kdenlive – Title Images"

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_images.rst:-1
msgid ""
"KDE, Kdenlive, documentation, user manual, video editor, open source, free, "
"learn, easy, titles, title clip, image"
msgstr ""
"KDE, Kdenlive, documentation, user manual, video editor, open source,free,  "
"learn, easy, titles, title clip, image"

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_images.rst:0
msgid "Preserve aspect ratio"
msgstr "Zachovať pomer strán"

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_images.rst:25
msgid "Images"
msgstr "Obrázky"

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_images.rst:27
msgid ""
"Click on |insert-image|, or use the keyboard shortcut :kbd:`Alt+I`. Using "
"the Open File dialog window select an image file to be inserted."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na |insert-image| alebo použite klávesovú skratku :kbd:`Alt+I`. V "
"dialógovom okne Otvoriť súbor vyberte obrazový súbor, ktorý sa má vložiť."

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_images.rst:29
msgid "The image properties can be set in the **Properties** tab."
msgstr "Vlastnosti obrázka možno nastaviť na karte **Vlastnosti**."

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_images.rst:38
msgid "The image properties tab"
msgstr "Karta vlastností obrázka"

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_images.rst:40
msgid ""
"**Note**: The selected image will be placed into the workspace using the top "
"left corner, i.e. the top left corner of the image is put into the top left "
"corner of the workspace. Therefore, small images may not be easy to find at "
"first."
msgstr ""
"**Poznámka**: Vybraný obrázok sa umiestni do pracovného priestoru pomocou "
"ľavého horného rohu, t. j. ľavý horný roh obrázka sa umiestni do ľavého "
"horného rohu pracovného priestoru. Preto malé obrázky nemusia byť spočiatku "
"ľahko viditeľné."

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_images.rst:44
msgid ""
"Set by default, it keeps the image's aspect ratio. Deselect this, if you "
"need to distort the image using the :guilabel:`W` and :guilabel:`H` "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"Predvolene nastavené, zachováva pomer strán obrázka. Zrušte výber, ak "
"potrebujete skresliť obrázok pomocou parametrov :guilabel:`Š` a :guilabel:"
"`V`."

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_images.rst:46
msgid ""
"An image can be scaled by entering values for the :guilabel:`W` and :"
"guilabel:`H` parameters, or by using the :guilabel:`Zoom` parameter. You can "
"grab the edges or the corners with the :kbd:`LMB` and adjust the size of the "
"image. Center resize with :kbd:`Shift+Drag`. Click into the image with the :"
"kbd:`LMB` and you can drag the image around."
msgstr ""
"Obrázok možno škálovať zadaním hodnôt pre parametre :guilabel:`Š` a :"
"guilabel:`V` alebo pomocou parametra :guilabel:`Priblíženie`. Môžete uchopiť "
"hrany alebo rohy pomocou :kbd:`LMB` a upraviť veľkosť obrázka. Zmena "
"veľkosti od stredu pomocou :kbd:`Shift+Ťahanie`. Kliknutím na obrázok "
"pomocou :kbd:`LMB` môžete obrázok presúvať."

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_images.rst:50
msgid "Object Zooming and Rotating"
msgstr "Priblíženie a otočenie objektu"

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_images.rst:51
msgid "An object can be zoomed and rotated."
msgstr "Objekt možno priblížiť a otočiť."

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_images.rst:61
msgid ""
"Sometimes zooming is easier than entering new values for :guilabel:`W` and :"
"guilabel:`H`. Enter a zoom percentage in the :guilabel:`Zoom` field."
msgstr ""
"Niekedy je priblíženie jednoduchšie ako zadávanie nových hodnôt pre :"
"guilabel:`Š` a :guilabel:`V`. Zadajte percento priblíženia do poľa :guilabel:"
"`Priblíženie`."

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_images.rst:63
msgid ""
"Rotating an object is possible by entering degrees of rotation into the :"
"guilabel:`Rotate X`, :guilabel:`Y`, and :guilabel:`Z` fields. Note that the "
"center of rotation is the top left corner of the object."
msgstr ""
"Otočenie objektu je možné zadaním stupňov otočenia do polí :guilabel:`Otočiť "
"X`, :guilabel:`Y` a :guilabel:`Z`. Upozorňujeme, že stred otáčania je ľavý "
"horný roh objektu."

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_images.rst:69
msgid "Object Stacking"
msgstr "Vrstvenie objektov"

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_images.rst:70
msgid ""
"The objects are placed on top of each other following the sequence in which "
"they were created. If you need to bring an object/item forward that was "
"created in the early stages, use the :guilabel:`Z-Index` field or click on "
"the respective icon (|object-order-raise|, |object-order-lower|, |object-"
"order-front|, |object-order-back|) in the stack toolbar. Likewise, you can "
"also send an object/item backwards."
msgstr ""
"Objekty sú umiestňované jeden na druhý v poradí, v akom boli vytvorené. Ak "
"potrebujete posunúť dopredu objekt/položku vytvorenú v počiatočných fázach, "
"použite pole :guilabel:`Z-Index` alebo kliknite na príslušnú ikonu (|object-"
"order-raise|, |object-order-lower|, |object-order-front|, |object-order-"
"back|) v paneli nástrojov vrstvenia. Rovnako môžete objekt/položku aj "
"posunúť dozadu."

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_images.rst:74
msgid "Object Alignment"
msgstr "Zarovnanie objektov"

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_images.rst:75
msgid ""
"Alignment to the project dimensions is possible using the icons in the "
"toolbar:"
msgstr ""
"Zarovnanie podľa rozmerov projektu je možné pomocou ikon v paneli nástrojov:"

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_images.rst:77
msgid ""
"|align-horizontal-left| :guilabel:`Align left` or |align-horizontal-right| :"
"guilabel:`Align right` moves the selected object towards the left or right "
"edge stopping at the edges of each of the safety boxes with each click on "
"the icon."
msgstr ""
"|align-horizontal-left| :guilabel:`Zarovnať vľavo` alebo |align-horizontal-"
"right| :guilabel:`Zarovnať vpravo` presúva vybraný objekt k ľavému alebo "
"pravému okraju, pričom sa zastaví na okrajoch každého ochranného poľa pri "
"každom kliknutí na ikonu."

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_images.rst:78
msgid ""
"|align-vertical-top| :guilabel:`Align top` or |align-vertical-bottom| :"
"guilabel:`Align bottom` moves the selected object towards the top or bottom "
"edge stopping at the edges of each of the safety boxes with each click on "
"the icon."
msgstr ""
"|align-vertical-top| :guilabel:`Zarovnať nahor` alebo |align-vertical-"
"bottom| :guilabel:`Zarovnať nadol` presúva vybraný objekt k hornému alebo "
"dolnému okraju, pričom sa zastaví na okrajoch každého ochranného poľa pri "
"každom kliknutí na ikonu."

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_images.rst:79
msgid ""
"|align-horizontal-center| :guilabel:`Align center horizontally` or |align-"
"vertical-center| :guilabel:`Align center vertically` centers the selected "
"object on the vertical or horizontal center axis of the outermost box."
msgstr ""
"|align-horizontal-center| :guilabel:`Zarovnať na stred vodorovne` alebo |"
"align-vertical-center| :guilabel:`Zarovnať na stred zvisle` vycentruje "
"vybraný objekt na zvislú alebo vodorovnú strednú os najvonkajšieho poľa."
